Why?  I understand the reasoning somewhat, but there can always be counter
examples.  For example, an Archaeologist is supposed by like Indiana Jones,
but sometimes Indiana Jones does not seem totally Lawful.  Why should a
Cave-man/woman always be lawful?  Elves were free to choose their alignment
in D&D, and there are evil doctors too... :-)  There are also evil samurai
in the past.  I also don't understand the reason why barbarians and
Valkyries are always chaotic.
